    '''
    This function calculates the compound amount at the given rate and rounds it to the nearest integer.

    Parameters:
    x (float): The initial principal amount. Must be positive.
    y (float): The additional contribution amount. Must be positive.
    z (float): The number of compounding periods per year. Must be positive.
    r (float): The interest rate per compounding period. Must be positive.
    rounding (str): The rounding mode. Can be 'nearest' (default), 'up', or 'down'.

